  <diagram name="Página-1" id="hJVAyEiuTO-GselZXIXW">
    <mxGraphModel dx="1041" dy="1174" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="827" pageHeight="1169" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <mxCell id="rh4tWCF5fXv3vGWnebjI-2" parent="1" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="&lt;h2 style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;1. Quadro de Leitura&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;table style=&quot;margin-bottom: 32px; font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;thead style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;tr style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border: 1px solid rgb(196, 199, 197); padding: 8px 12px; font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;Item&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border: 1px solid rgb(196, 199, 197); padding: 8px 12px; font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;Leitura nos dois sentidos, com a cardinalidade&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border: 1px solid rgb(196, 199, 197); padding: 8px 12px; font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;Regra que justifica&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/thead&gt;&lt;tbody style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;tr style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border: 1px solid rgb(196, 199, 197); padding: 8px 12px; font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;Funcionário e Departamento&lt;/b&gt; (&lt;i style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;trabalha em&lt;/i&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border: 1px solid rgb(196, 199, 197); padding: 8px 12px; font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;• &lt;b style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;Sentido Funcionário → Departamento:&lt;/b&gt; Um funcionário trabalha em no mínimo 1 e no máximo 2 departamentos ao longo do tempo &lt;b style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;(1, 2)&lt;/b&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;• &lt;b style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;Sentido Departamento → Funcionário:&lt;/b&gt; Um departamento é integrado por no mínimo 1 e no máximo muitos funcionários &lt;b style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;(1, N)&lt;/b&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border: 1px solid rgb(196, 199, 197); padding: 8px 12px; font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;Regra 3:&lt;/b&gt; A base registra 268.445 funcionários que passaram por 1 departamento e 31.579 que passaram por 2 (faixa de 1 a 2). Os 9 departamentos possuem funcionários, variando de 17.346 a 85.707 cada (mínimo de 1 e máximo de muitos).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border: 1px solid rgb(196, 199, 197); padding: 8px 12px; font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;Funcionário e Cargo ocupado&lt;/b&gt; (&lt;i style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;ocupa&lt;/i&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border: 1px solid rgb(196, 199, 197); padding: 8px 12px; font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;• &lt;b style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;Sentido Funcionário → Cargo ocupado:&lt;/b&gt; Um funcionário ocupa no mínimo 1 e no máximo 3 cargos ao longo do tempo &lt;b style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;(1, 3)&lt;/b&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;• &lt;b style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;Sentido Cargo ocupado → Funcionário:&lt;/b&gt; Um registro de cargo ocupado pertence a exatamente 1 e no máximo 1 funcionário &lt;b style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;(1, 1)&lt;/b&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border: 1px solid rgb(196, 199, 197); padding: 8px 12px; font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;Regras 5 e 6:&lt;/b&gt; A Regra 5 determina que um funcionário ocupa 1, 2 ou 3 cargos (140.270 tiveram mais de um cargo). A Regra 6 estabelece que o cargo não tem código próprio e é identificado pelo funcionário, dependendo da sua existência (&lt;code style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;ON DELETE CASCADE&lt;/code&gt;).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border: 1px solid rgb(196, 199, 197); padding: 8px 12px; font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;Entidade fraca&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border: 1px solid rgb(196, 199, 197); padding: 8px 12px; font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;A entidade fraca é &lt;b style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;Cargo ocupado&lt;/b&gt;, que depende diretamente da entidade forte &lt;b style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;Funcionário&lt;/b&gt; para existir e ser identificada univocamente.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border: 1px solid rgb(196, 199, 197); padding: 8px 12px; font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;Regra 6:&lt;/b&gt; O registro de cargo não possui ID próprio e depende da chave da entidade &lt;code style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;Funcionário&lt;/code&gt; (combinada com nome do cargo e data de início). Se o funcionário for removido, seus cargos associados são apagados junto.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;h2 style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="670" width="560" x="94" y="10" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="rh4tWCF5fXv3vGWnebjI-3" parent="1" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="&lt;h2 style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;2. Quadro de Defesa (Defesa de Decisão do DER)&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;table style=&quot;margin-bottom: 32px; font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;thead style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;tr style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border: 1px solid rgb(196, 199, 197); padding: 8px 12px; font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;Campo&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border: 1px solid rgb(196, 199, 197); padding: 8px 12px; font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;Preenchimento do Aluno&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/thead&gt;&lt;tbody style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;tr style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border: 1px solid rgb(196, 199, 197); padding: 8px 12px; font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;Decisão de modelagem explicada:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border: 1px solid rgb(196, 199, 197); padding: 8px 12px; font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;Modelar &lt;b style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;Cargo ocupado&lt;/b&gt; como uma &lt;b style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;Entidade Fraca&lt;/b&gt; conectada por um &lt;b style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;Relacionamento Identificador&lt;/b&gt; (&lt;code style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;ocupa&lt;/code&gt;), em vez de modelá-la como uma entidade forte com um código/ID primário próprio.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border: 1px solid rgb(196, 199, 197); padding: 8px 12px; font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;Dado da base usado como evidência:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border: 1px solid rgb(196, 199, 197); padding: 8px 12px; font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;Regra 6 e Regra 5:&lt;/b&gt; A base possui 140.270 funcionários com múltiplos cargos, porém nenhum registro de cargo possui um código de identificação próprio. A identificação depende univocamente da combinação do número do funcionário, nome do cargo e data de início. Além disso, a base aplica a regra de integridade &lt;code style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;ON DELETE CASCADE&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border: 1px solid rgb(196, 199, 197); padding: 8px 12px; font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;Defesa da decisão e resposta respeitosa a uma decisão diferente:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;border: 1px solid rgb(196, 199, 197); padding: 8px 12px; font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;Compreendo a visão de quem opta por criar uma entidade forte com um ID numérico auto-incremento para &lt;code style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;Cargo ocupado&lt;/code&gt;, pois isso facilita a criação de chaves primárias simples em bancos relacionais físicos. No entanto, do ponto de vista conceitual e de aderência aos dados reais da base &lt;i style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;Employees&lt;/i&gt;, a modelagem como &lt;b style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;&quot;&gt;Entidade Fraca&lt;/b&gt; é a escolha mais precisa. Ela reflete exatamente a dependência de existência (um cargo não existe sem um funcionário) e a dependência de identificação (o registro só é único quando associado ao ID do funcionário). Modelar dessa forma garante a aplicação da exclusão em cascata e impede a existência de cargos &quot;fantasmas&quot; desconectados de um funcionário.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="403" width="560" x="110" y="597" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
</mxfile>
